{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Choppy Cuts",
    "steam_appid": 2947650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/d1d7a3eff694667093d1fbd8278f6e60.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Choppy Cuts, fun and chaos go hand in hand. You can team up with friends to tackle a variety of hairdressing challenges. Work together to create amazing hairstyles and have a blast along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc88<strong>Be Quick!</strong> \ud83d\udc88 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever it is, just toss it over \u2014 even the customers! Efficiency is our top priority!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/9701563c170f55db6e73127edd7dda2d.poster.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/9701563c170f55db6e73127edd7dda2d.webm?t=1754653515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude92<strong>Team up! </strong>\ud83e\ude92</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to go for three stars? Every task demands precision and perfect teamwork. Rally your friends and show off your team spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/f602b5db1c8f9b26d277c0d747ffdf9a.poster.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/f602b5db1c8f9b26d277c0d747ffdf9a.webm?t=1754653515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2702\ufe0f<strong>Snip and clip! </strong>\u2702\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your hairstylist character, wield a range of unique tools, and journey through diverse universes, leaving no hair uncut! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/c84ed2a583028d4be8eab479175d0749.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in its early demo stage and is under continuous development. Stay tuned for exciting updates, including new levels, modes, characters, outfits, and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We truly value every player's experience and are committed to staying closely connected with our community. Your feedback is essential in helping us create a more complete and enjoyable game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/d1d7a3eff694667093d1fbd8278f6e60.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Choppy Cuts, fun and chaos go hand in hand. You can team up with friends to tackle a variety of hairdressing challenges. Work together to create amazing hairstyles and have a blast along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc88<strong>Be Quick!</strong> \ud83d\udc88 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever it is, just toss it over \u2014 even the customers! Efficiency is our top priority!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/9701563c170f55db6e73127edd7dda2d.poster.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/9701563c170f55db6e73127edd7dda2d.webm?t=1754653515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude92<strong>Team up! </strong>\ud83e\ude92</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to go for three stars? Every task demands precision and perfect teamwork. Rally your friends and show off your team spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/f602b5db1c8f9b26d277c0d747ffdf9a.poster.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/f602b5db1c8f9b26d277c0d747ffdf9a.webm?t=1754653515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2702\ufe0f<strong>Snip and clip! </strong>\u2702\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your hairstylist character, wield a range of unique tools, and journey through diverse universes, leaving no hair uncut! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947650/extras/c84ed2a583028d4be8eab479175d0749.avif?t=1754653515\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in its early demo stage and is under continuous development. Stay tuned for exciting updates, including new levels, modes, characters, outfits, and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We truly value every player's experience and are committed to staying closely connected with our community. Your feedback is essential in helping us create a more complete and enjoyable game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Choppy Cuts! In this light-hearted multiplayer cooperative game, you'll become hair salon employees, working together to meet the diverse needs of various customers. Through teamwork, you'll complete a series of hairdressing tasks, earn bonuses, and challenge your skills.",
